sequenceDiagram
    participant E as egui UI
    participant R as Rust Reducer
    participant G as Hermes Gateway
    participant D as Doofus Bridge
    E->>R: User submits prompt
    R->>G: prompt.submit with request ID
    G-->>R: accepted or error (not equivalent to completion)
    G-->>R: message.delta / tool.start
    R-->>E: render progress by stable identity
    G->>R: server request: approval / vault / clarify
    R->>E: typed modal with permission and scope
    E->>R: explicit allow or deny
    R->>G: response with original request ID
    G-->>R: tool.complete / message.complete
    D-->>R: canonical event seq + outcome refs
    R-->>E: update only after canonical proof
    Note over R,D: Persist cursor; repair gaps from snapshot; never replay mutation automatically
